    "Val.2H.1.true": "I've been neglecting Gunther and Marlon, but I didn't realize that... hm.$6#$b#Well, for right now, you're my priority. First round's on me... aye?$4#$b#After this, we could head back home - to check up on the Pepper Rex egg, of course.$19",
